WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:38.580 --> 00:01:40.660
Watch where you're stepping!
You could have killed us!

3
00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:43.370
Oops! Sorry!

4
00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:47.800
Look at you.

5
00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:51.590
Bonney's not the only one
who's had a growth spurt.

6
00:01:51.590 --> 00:01:54.300
You won't lay a finger on Old Man Apple.

7
00:01:54.680 --> 00:01:57.430
Listen, kid, some of us have jobs.

8
00:01:57.930 --> 00:02:01.140
Let me go back to doing mine, please.

9
00:02:02.350 --> 00:02:04.770
Let you go? Okay.

10
00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:19.830
Whee! Whoa-whoa.

11
00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:26.000
Get ready!

12
00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:35.550
Is this really necessary?!

13
00:02:37.890 --> 00:02:39.890
Whoa, take it easy!

14
00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:56.200
<b>Luffy vs. Kizaru</b>

15
00:02:52.030 --> 00:02:54.450
Look at him flying!

16
00:02:58.160 --> 00:03:00.160
We have to run now! Let's hurry!

17
00:03:00.160 --> 00:03:03.620
Yeah. You're right. Let's go!
While Luffy keeps Kizaru busy!

18
00:03:03.620 --> 00:03:06.620
Okay, but we have to be gentle with Robin!

19
00:03:08.210 --> 00:03:11.050
Hey Atlas! You need me?

20
00:03:11.050 --> 00:03:14.510
I'm going down below.
I have to take control of the Pacifistas!

21
00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:16.180
Otherwise.

22
00:03:16.180 --> 00:03:18.220
as soon as the barrier goes down.

23
00:03:22.680 --> 00:03:25.140
your lasers will blow us to smithereens!

24
00:03:25.140 --> 00:03:26.940
That's good thinking!

25
00:03:26.940 --> 00:03:29.730
Us Vegapunks are the highest authority on the island,

26
00:03:29.730 --> 00:03:33.590
after all. And whoever controls
the Pacifistas, wins!

27
00:03:33.940 --> 00:03:36.030
Hell, yeah! We got this!

28
00:03:36.530 --> 00:03:37.740
Atlas, wait!

29
00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:40.740
I mean to say,

30
00:03:40.740 --> 00:03:42.990
please take me with you!

31
00:03:42.990 --> 00:03:43.620
– What?!
– What?!

32
00:03:44.370 --> 00:03:46.210
You cannot go!

33
00:03:46.210 --> 00:03:47.040
Why not?

34
00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:51.540
Are you kidding me?!

35
00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:53.090
I know, but.

36
00:03:53.090 --> 00:03:54.670
Come in, Franky!

37
00:03:54.670 --> 00:03:56.800
This is Vegapunk, can you hear me?!

38
00:03:56.800 --> 00:03:57.630
What's up?

39
00:03:57.630 --> 00:03:59.800
I just saw Bonney down in the city!

40
00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:02.180
She's alive then?! What a relief!

41
00:04:02.180 --> 00:04:05.060
She hit the barrier! Kizaru kicked her hard!

42
00:04:05.060 --> 00:04:06.810
Kizaru did what?!

43
00:04:06.810 --> 00:04:10.230
And you just stood there and watched?!
You are a good man!

44
00:04:10.230 --> 00:04:11.690
I'm sorry! Okay?!

45
00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:13.690
I'll go save her right now!

46
00:04:13.690 --> 00:04:14.650
You'd better!

47
00:04:14.650 --> 00:04:16.780
What are we gonna do about the barrier?

48
00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:20.530
I've made up my mind. I'm going!

49
00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:21.120
What?!

50
00:04:21.620 --> 00:04:23.870
We'll have Edison deactivate the barrier.

51
00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:29.210
Hey, It's Sanji.

52
00:04:29.210 --> 00:04:30.960
<b>Second Floor
Building A</b>

53
00:04:29.910 --> 00:04:32.710
I heard what you said! All of it!

54
00:04:35.800 --> 00:04:39.630
You're gonna go in and rescue her, right?
Then you can count me in!

55
00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:44.350
Our work here is done. We picked up the luggage
you asked us to, and we're on our way!

56
00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:47.180
I'll head toward the rear exit immediately!

57
00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:48.980
Let's all meet up there!

58
00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:51.650
Go go, go!

59
00:04:49.020 --> 00:04:53.190
<b>Below
In the Fabriophase</b>

60
00:04:51.650 --> 00:04:52.560
Oh crap!

61
00:04:54.110 --> 00:04:55.230
Did something just move?

62
00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:56.940
Hey! What are you doing?

63
00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.690
It's this way! Hurry up!

64
00:04:58.690 --> 00:04:59.570
Yes, sir!

65
00:05:03.780 --> 00:05:05.660
I guess it's dangerous here, too.

66
00:05:18.880 --> 00:05:20.050
Come get some!

67
00:05:28.310 --> 00:05:30.080
What was that scream?!

68
00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:32.270
Come on!

69
00:05:32.270 --> 00:05:33.600
What's going on?!

70
00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.410
Stop!

71
00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.500
I know you.

72
00:05:50.500 --> 00:05:53.330
Report! What happened?!

73
00:05:53.330 --> 00:05:55.380
Wait, what's that?

74
00:06:15.560 --> 00:06:18.400
D-Dammit.

75
00:06:20.070 --> 00:06:21.610
Reporting in.

76
00:06:21.610 --> 00:06:24.570
We've all been turned
into children or old people!

77
00:06:25.620 --> 00:06:26.820
What?!

78
00:06:26.820 --> 00:06:29.830
Everyone evade the center
of town! It's a trap!

79
00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:33.380
All central units were ambushed
by Jewelry Bonney!

80
00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:35.630
Search the surrounding zones cautiously!

81
00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:38.000
She has the power to change your age!

82
00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.420
She couldn't have gone too far!

83
00:06:42.420 --> 00:06:46.090
Find Jewelry Bonney and take her down!

84
00:06:48.220 --> 00:06:49.220
Damn it!

85
00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:50.680
Hey! Over here!

86
00:06:51.810 --> 00:06:53.600
I found Sentomaru!

87
00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:55.390
But he.

88
00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:58.810
looks like he's been burned.

89
00:06:59.570 --> 00:07:01.110
Sentomaru.

90
00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:15.620
Sentomaru?

91
00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:17.500
Run away.

92
00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.090
Bonney.

93
00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:22.490
The Marines... are coming.

94
00:07:27.760 --> 00:07:29.100
Sentomaru!

95
00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:32.220
What should I do?

96
00:07:32.220 --> 00:07:32.970
Have you found her?

97
00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:33.770
Not yet, sir.

98
00:07:33.770 --> 00:07:34.680
Check that way!

99
00:07:34.680 --> 00:07:35.560
Yes, sir!

100
00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:40.940
I wonder if I can hide till this is all over.

101
00:07:42.480 --> 00:07:45.490
<b>Labophase</b>

102
00:07:47.820 --> 00:07:48.950
Hey!

103
00:07:48.950 --> 00:07:50.830
Just fight me already!

104
00:07:52.030 --> 00:07:54.910
You have nothing to gain from this, Roronoa.

105
00:07:55.290 --> 00:07:58.120
Stay out of our way and let us do our job!

106
00:08:09.010 --> 00:08:11.100
It doesn't matter if you hide,

107
00:08:11.850 --> 00:08:14.020
it doesn't matter how fast you run,

108
00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:17.190
I know right where you are!

109
00:08:17.980 --> 00:08:20.400
Cause you stink like a beast!

110
00:09:05.440 --> 00:09:07.070
Whoa, was that pigeon guy!

111
00:09:07.070 --> 00:09:10.070
Zoro, want my help?

112
00:09:13.070 --> 00:09:15.530
What?!

113
00:09:21.290 --> 00:09:24.250
Just focus on Kizaru! He's the real problem!

114
00:09:45.520 --> 00:09:47.610
You're barely keeping up.

115
00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:52.570
If this is the best you can do, you're never
gonna get another shot at our captain.

116
00:09:54.320 --> 00:09:56.080
But I've still got you.

117
00:09:56.080 --> 00:09:58.450
An emperor's first mate.

118
00:09:58.450 --> 00:10:00.540
That's a worthy trophy.

119
00:10:19.220 --> 00:10:20.770
I might drown.

120
00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.350
That won't do at all.

121
00:10:30.440 --> 00:10:35.220
Yasakani Sacred Jewel.

122
00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:49.910
Hey, that hurts.

123
00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:24.580
Ouch! My face!

124
00:11:39.010 --> 00:11:40.550
I've seen these!

125
00:11:55.530 --> 00:11:57.490
Oh, come on. Again with this?

126
00:12:19.130 --> 00:12:22.810
Well, it's fine. A bigger target is easier to hit.

127
00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:24.270
So thank you for that.

128
00:12:46.120 --> 00:12:48.370
I don't know which one is real!

129
00:12:57.010 --> 00:12:58.220
Just kidding.

130
00:12:58.800 --> 00:13:00.010
I'll hit them all!

131
00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:01.890
Gum-Gum.

132
00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:28.370
I get him?

133
00:13:36.800 --> 00:13:39.590
I thought I was the one tricking you!

134
00:13:39.590 --> 00:13:42.300
Now, this is unfortunate.

135
00:13:42.680 --> 00:13:45.930
I leave for one second and Vegapunk is gone.

136
00:13:45.930 --> 00:13:48.270
Could you tell me where he is, please?

137
00:13:48.270 --> 00:13:50.980
Hey, Luffy, I could use a little help right now.

138
00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:10.410
Wait! Hey, Vegapunk! Let me in there!

139
00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:12.830
You're really worked up!

140
00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.250
Not that I blame you, though.

141
00:14:14.250 --> 00:14:17.130
Don't you touch her,
you bootlicking Navy scum!

142
00:14:17.130 --> 00:14:20.760
Never fear, Bonney!
I'm on my way! Stay strong!

143
00:14:20.760 --> 00:14:24.390
I should have protected you!
You poor darling child!

144
00:14:24.390 --> 00:14:25.970
Poor darling child?

145
00:14:25.970 --> 00:14:27.850
Get in already!

146
00:14:27.850 --> 00:14:31.020
I'll let you in the bubble!
Just shove yourself through!

147
00:14:31.480 --> 00:14:33.190
Well, if you say so.

148
00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:44.570
What are you doing?! Stay in the dome thing!

149
00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:46.990
You're gonna get killed out here!

150
00:14:49.620 --> 00:14:52.000
Did you think I'd just let you run?

151
00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:56.210
This is over, old man.

152
00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:58.710
Do something, Stella! He's going to kill us all!

153
00:15:19.310 --> 00:15:20.730
Back already?!

154
00:15:22.360 --> 00:15:23.440
Whoa, Stella!

155
00:15:23.440 --> 00:15:24.700
Change of plans!

156
00:15:24.700 --> 00:15:27.490
We'll use General Franky to carry the Sunny!

157
00:15:28.160 --> 00:15:30.080
I'm catching a ride with these bros!

158
00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:31.580
Okay.

159
00:15:59.190 --> 00:16:00.900
Edison! Do it!

160
00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:02.400
Right away!

161
00:16:02.400 --> 00:16:03.860
Frontier Dome,

162
00:16:03.860 --> 00:16:05.740
partially deactivate!

163
00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:09.530
Reactivate!

164
00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:15.520
Can this thing fly?!

165
00:16:25.670 --> 00:16:27.420
Wait. What's that?

166
00:16:28.300 --> 00:16:29.890
Something's up there!

167
00:16:29.890 --> 00:16:32.700
Hold on! I think I can see inside.

168
00:16:32.850 --> 00:16:34.810
It's Dr. Vegapunk!

169
00:16:35.390 --> 00:16:39.100
<b>Off the Coast of Egghead</b>

170
00:16:36.480 --> 00:16:39.100
I have a report from the Fabriophase!

171
00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:40.400
It's urgent!

172
00:16:40.400 --> 00:16:44.650
We've just spotted Vegapunk! He's descending
from the Labophase in a vehicle!

173
00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:47.030
Take aim! Prepare to fire!

174
00:16:56.120 --> 00:16:57.870
Pacifistas!

175
00:16:58.460 --> 00:17:02.460
You have a new order, direct
from Dr. Vegapunk!

176
00:17:02.460 --> 00:17:04.750
Every Marine on the island.

177
00:17:06.800 --> 00:17:10.800
must be eliminated!

178
00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:39.750
This is bad!

179
00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:41.420
I think it's time to run!

180
00:17:42.460 --> 00:17:44.330
New target designated.

181
00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:47.800
Destroy all Marines on Egghead.

182
00:17:52.720 --> 00:17:55.470
Get away from the Pacifistas!

183
00:18:04.100 --> 00:18:08.870
They have a new order!
Dr. Vegapunk must have taken control back!

184
00:18:13.450 --> 00:18:15.250
So many Pacifistas!

185
00:18:15.250 --> 00:18:17.120
How are we supposed to fight them all?

186
00:18:18.830 --> 00:18:20.580
Damn you, Vegapunk!

187
00:18:21.540 --> 00:18:24.250
Yeah! Now it's a party!

188
00:18:24.970 --> 00:18:28.630
Let it rip, Pacifistas!

189
00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:31.630
Seems they're all responding to the command!

190
00:18:31.630 --> 00:18:32.550
Yeah!

191
00:18:35.800 --> 00:18:36.510
Hold up!

192
00:18:36.890 --> 00:18:40.020
It looks like we're going straight down!
We're not gonna dive bomb

193
00:18:40.020 --> 00:18:41.600
into the ground, are we?

194
00:18:41.600 --> 00:18:45.850
We are on Island Clouds.
It's in their nature to attach to one another.

195
00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:51.400
Since our tires are also made of clouds,
we won't fall to our deaths, even if we head straight down!

196
00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:54.860
But enough about our ride.
We must find Bonney!

197
00:18:54.860 --> 00:18:57.870
She's surely alone and terrified down there!

198
00:18:57.870 --> 00:18:59.490
Hey, Bonney, where are you?!

199
00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:02.370
Bonney!

200
00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:03.790
Hey, Bonney!

201
00:19:03.790 --> 00:19:06.290
Bonney!

202
00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:15.260
I need to focus!

203
00:19:16.130 --> 00:19:17.760
Don't think! Feel!

204
00:19:18.230 --> 00:19:20.810
I'll reach out across the entire universe

205
00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:24.200
and sense her with the waves of my soul!

206
00:19:34.570 --> 00:19:36.490
My Lady-dar got a ping!

207
00:19:36.490 --> 00:19:37.700
I found her!

208
00:19:37.870 --> 00:19:39.700
Where is she?!

209
00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:41.700
All I can see are Marines everywhere I look!

210
00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:44.200
Same for me. Are you sure?!

211
00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:46.960
Don't question me,
my Lady-dar's never wrong!

212
00:19:46.960 --> 00:19:48.830
Oh, yeah?

213
00:19:48.830 --> 00:19:53.340
I dispute the science of your methods,
but I will trust your instinct!

214
00:19:53.340 --> 00:19:54.720
Thanks, Doctor!

215
00:19:55.340 --> 00:19:57.050
Now, if you'll all excuse me,

216
00:19:57.550 --> 00:20:00.510
this tank just can't keep up
with my impatient heart!

217
00:20:02.970 --> 00:20:06.520
Don't worry, Bonney! I'm on my way!

218
00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:09.980
What a relief.

219
00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:12.860
Looks like the Pacifistas are back on our side.

220
00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:25.830
Thought you could hide, huh?

221
00:20:25.830 --> 00:20:28.920
This is over, Jewelry Bonney!

222
00:20:28.330 --> 00:20:31.290
<b>Vice Admiral Pomsky
Marine Headquarters</b>

223
00:20:28.920 --> 00:20:31.290
You'll pay for what you did to our men!

224
00:20:32.540 --> 00:20:34.300
Over there! Go!

225
00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:14.290
What the hell's wrong with you three?!

226
00:21:14.290 --> 00:21:17.380
I think I just went to hell.

227
00:21:19.220 --> 00:21:21.470
Get back here, I'm not done with you!

228
00:21:25.600 --> 00:21:26.970
You cannot escape!

229
00:21:31.310 --> 00:21:32.690
Why?!

230
00:21:33.110 --> 00:21:38.570
Ha. I can't command all the Pacifistas,
but I snuck around the rules for this one!

231
00:21:39.820 --> 00:21:42.700
I have the power to control anything I sit on!

232
00:21:40.570 --> 00:21:45.530
<b>Vice Admiral Bluegrass
Marine Headquarters</b>

233
00:21:42.700 --> 00:21:45.530
Cause I'm a Driving Human
who ate the Ride-Ride Fruit!

234
00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:51.810
Now, here's a little question. Will that curse
you placed on our men be lifted if I kill you?

235
00:21:56.670 --> 00:21:58.510
Dad.

236
00:21:58.510 --> 00:22:00.850
Last chance, kiddo!

237
00:22:00.850 --> 00:22:03.590
Change them back now!

238
00:22:12.020 --> 00:22:14.230
Come on, Bonney, don't zone out on us now.

239
00:22:16.310 --> 00:22:17.820
Black Leg!

240
00:22:18.570 --> 00:22:21.530
Look, I get it.
It's because Kuma's your father, right?

241
00:22:25.530 --> 00:22:28.540
You have to remember
they're not him! If you can't.

242
00:22:31.250 --> 00:22:33.750
Otter Hammer!

243
00:22:36.500 --> 00:22:38.300
Marines everywhere!

244
00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:42.260
Time for us to go!

245
00:22:42.260 --> 00:22:45.760
Go, Pacifista! Fire!

246
00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:48.930
Ah, Smith!

247
00:23:00.190 --> 00:23:02.530
Get in the Bubble! Let's roll! Hurry!

248
00:23:04.110 --> 00:23:07.620
The Pacifistas will fire on us!
Let's head back up!

249
00:23:07.620 --> 00:23:09.740
Oh, just shake it off already!

250
00:23:44.820 --> 00:23:50.370
<b>Labophase</b>

251
00:24:04.970 --> 00:24:07.090
It's no use resisting!

252
00:24:07.090 --> 00:24:09.890
Your fate is already sealed!

253
00:24:09.930 --> 00:24:12.010
This guy never learns.

254
00:24:15.820 --> 00:24:23.220
Uh-uh.

255
00:24:33.030 --> 00:24:37.290
Look, I don't know why you're doing this,
but I've got orders to follow.

256
00:24:40.500 --> 00:24:42.460
I don't care!

257
00:24:53.890 --> 00:24:56.730
The clock is ticking! Struggle while you can!

258
00:24:59.390 --> 00:25:02.020
Sure like to talk, don't you?

259
00:25:12.570 --> 00:25:19.210
If you'll excuse me, I have a mission to wrap up
and you are wasting too much of my time!

260
00:25:24.290 --> 00:25:25.840
That's the idea!

261
00:25:27.010 --> 00:25:29.630
It's my mission to get in your way!

262
00:25:52.030 --> 00:25:54.370
What to do?

263
00:26:12.260 --> 00:26:13.760
Why did you stop? What's wrong?

264
00:26:14.260 --> 00:26:15.640
It's weird.

265
00:26:15.640 --> 00:26:17.600
Something doesn't feel right.

266
00:26:17.600 --> 00:26:21.060
What is this? Such an unnatural presence!

267
00:26:38.660 --> 00:26:40.620
I can't believe what I'm seeing!

268
00:26:41.660 --> 00:26:44.960
All units, stand down.

269
00:26:53.800 --> 00:26:54.970
The Pacifistas aren't

270
00:26:54.970 --> 00:26:58.010
protecting us anymore!
They're not even moving!

271
00:26:58.010 --> 00:26:59.760
Come on! I gave you an order!

272
00:26:59.760 --> 00:27:01.720
Eliminate all the Marines!

273
00:27:01.720 --> 00:27:04.140
You're supposed to keep us safe!

274
00:27:04.890 --> 00:27:06.900
Something's happening!

275
00:27:08.980 --> 00:27:12.320
There's only one above Vegapunk
on the authority ladder.

276
00:27:12.740 --> 00:27:13.950
and that's.

277
00:27:14.860 --> 00:27:16.740
the Five Elders!

278
00:27:20.120 --> 00:27:22.580
What is that?!

279
00:27:32.920 --> 00:27:34.380
It's a pentagram!

280
00:27:45.270 --> 00:27:46.440
What the hell?!

281
00:27:46.440 --> 00:27:48.940
Step on it! Get to high ground!

282
00:27:48.940 --> 00:27:49.650
I'll try!

283
00:27:53.530 --> 00:27:55.240
Attention all Marines!

284
00:27:55.610 --> 00:28:00.700
St. Saturn is on his way!
He will arrive on Egghead shortly!

285
00:28:01.200 --> 00:28:05.410
Not a single Marine below the rank
of Commodore may be in his presence!

286
00:28:06.660 --> 00:28:07.870
He's coming here?!

287
00:28:07.870 --> 00:28:09.330
I repeat, St.

288
00:28:09.330 --> 00:28:13.920
Saturn and the Five Elders
will make landfall on Egghead!

289
00:28:21.720 --> 00:28:24.140
What was that explosion?!

290
00:28:24.720 --> 00:28:28.480
One of the Five Elders.
So I'm shocked that they came in person!

291
00:28:28.480 --> 00:28:29.850
The Five Elders?!

292
00:28:29.850 --> 00:28:31.520
Never heard of them! Who are they?!

293
00:28:31.520 --> 00:28:33.570
The highest authorities in the world!

294
00:28:33.570 --> 00:28:35.910
Wait! For real?!

295
00:28:57.840 --> 00:28:59.220
Something big's coming out!

296
00:29:25.620 --> 00:29:26.870
What the hell is that?!

297
00:29:26.870 --> 00:29:28.370
It's some kind of monster!

298
00:29:28.370 --> 00:29:29.290
Cut it out!

299
00:29:29.620 --> 00:29:31.210
That must be.

300
00:29:40.010 --> 00:29:42.960
Ah. The surface.

301
00:29:43.340 --> 00:29:45.940
It's been quite a while.

302
00:29:46.180 --> 00:29:50.140
<b>St. Jaygarcia Saturn
Godhead of Science and Defense
Five Elders, Highest Authority of the World Government</b>

303
00:29:50.140 --> 00:29:52.350
That's huge! What is that thing?!

304
00:29:54.520 --> 00:29:55.520
Above us!

305
00:29:55.520 --> 00:29:56.480
Dodge!

306
00:30:00.150 --> 00:30:02.360
Oops.

307
00:30:02.360 --> 00:30:04.570
That was a close one.

308
00:30:04.570 --> 00:30:07.850
We don't have any clouds to grasp!

309
00:30:09.500 --> 00:30:10.910
Kizaru!

310
00:30:14.170 --> 00:30:17.880
I found you! Get back here!

311
00:30:18.420 --> 00:30:22.800
Boy, you gotta be running out of juice.
That form won't hold up.

312
00:30:22.800 --> 00:30:24.800
Do something, Luffy!

313
00:30:24.800 --> 00:30:28.810
We're literally gonna die!

314
00:30:35.520 --> 00:30:36.360
I got you!

315
00:31:06.970 --> 00:31:10.060
No, I don't like that!

316
00:31:15.770 --> 00:31:17.230
Nika.

317
00:31:41.250 --> 00:31:43.590
You okay, Doc? Still breathing?

318
00:31:43.590 --> 00:31:45.590
So it would seem.

319
00:31:45.590 --> 00:31:47.590
Atlas, are you hurt?!

320
00:31:47.590 --> 00:31:48.550
I'm okay.

321
00:31:55.600 --> 00:31:57.310
Are you St. Saturn?

322
00:31:57.310 --> 00:31:58.860
I am.

323
00:32:01.320 --> 00:32:07.110
I thought you were already dead,
Vegapunk. What a shame.

324
00:32:13.120 --> 00:32:16.580
I gave you an order, Vegapunk.

325
00:32:26.090 --> 00:32:27.130
Bonney, wait!

326
00:32:30.090 --> 00:32:34.060
You must eliminate Kuma's free will.

327
00:32:36.730 --> 00:32:39.900
But if I do that to him, sir.

328
00:32:55.870 --> 00:32:59.830
I'll kill you!

329
00:33:16.170 --> 00:33:21.260
Running so long lost track of just how long its been

330
00:33:22.110 --> 00:33:28.620
Collected scars while striving not even trying beneath my skin

331
00:33:29.120 --> 00:33:36.040
But in the back of my head the dream is not dead I remember a map

332
00:33:36.120 --> 00:33:42.330
to a treasure still gleaming its within our grasp

333
00:33:42.470 --> 00:33:49.240
Can you feel my heart Feelings I impart

334
00:33:49.200 --> 00:33:56.350
The promises are there theyre deep down but still primed to share

335
00:33:56.480 --> 00:34:05.460
Peerless dreams kept close the dreams that always matter most

336
00:34:05.640 --> 00:34:11.210
Before we set sail why not raise a toast

337
00:34:11.330 --> 00:34:18.240
So I pen this note to you Dear sunrise Ill see you soon

338
00:34:18.400 --> 00:34:25.430
See the smile I saw the day that I sang this song to you

339
00:34:25.410 --> 00:34:32.480
And regardless of our age these memries will still remain

340
00:34:32.380 --> 00:34:39.590
Wont forget until this wish makes it to you
